<view class="tr-page complete-page"><block wx:if="{{submitted}}"><view class="tr-result-head"><view class="tr-result-rays"></view><view class="tr-result-symbol"><yx-icon name="yes" tone="brand" size="72"/></view><text class="tr-result-kicker">向喜欢的好物，再近一步</text><text class="tr-result-title">收货资料已提交</text><text class="tr-result-sub">可以在「我的试用」查看后续进度。</text></view><view class="tr-result-content"><view class="tr-receipt ui-card"><view class="tr-receipt-heading"><text>本次试用收货资料</text><text class="tr-tag">资料已提交</text></view><block wx:if="{{trialRecord.trial_pro}}"><view class="tr-product-row"><view class="tr-small-product"><image wx:if="{{trialRecord.trial_pro.pro_picurl&&!productImageFailed}}" src="{{trialRecord.trial_pro.pro_picurl}}" mode="aspectFill" binderror="productImageError"/><yx-icon wx:else name="gift" tone="muted" size="62"/></view><view class="tr-product-copy"><text class="tr-product-title">{{trialRecord.trial_pro.pro_title}}</text><text class="tr-product-sub">收货资料已记录</text></view></view></block><view class="tr-receipt-address"><yx-icon name="location" tone="brand" size="44"/><view><text>{{recipient.name}}　{{recipient.phone}}</text><text>{{recipient.address}}</text></view></view></view><view class="tr-submitted-path"><view><view><yx-icon name="yes" tone="brand" size="28"/></view><text>资料已提交</text></view><view class="tr-path-line"></view><view><view><yx-icon name="package" tone="muted" size="30"/></view><text>等待后续配送</text></view></view><text class="tr-fulfillment-note">配送安排及处理进度，以活动实际规则和
「我的试用」显示的信息为准。</text><button open-type="contact" class="ui-text-button">需要帮助？联系客服 ›</button></view><view class="tr-fixed-footer"><button class="ui-primary" bindtap="goHistory">返回我的试用</button></view></block>
 <view wx:else class="ui-page tr-complete-form"><text class="tr-form-kicker">中选后，完善本次收货资料</text><text class="tr-form-title">把好物，寄到你身边。</text><text class="tr-form-lead">请核对姓名、电话及完整地址。收货资料仅用于本次活动履约。</text><view wx:if="{{trialRecord.trial_pro}}" class="tr-application-card ui-card"><view class="tr-product-row"><view class="tr-small-product"><image wx:if="{{trialRecord.trial_pro.pro_picurl&&!productImageFailed}}" src="{{trialRecord.trial_pro.pro_picurl}}" mode="aspectFill" binderror="productImageError"/><yx-icon wx:else name="gift" tone="muted" size="62"/></view><view class="tr-product-copy"><text class="tr-product-title">{{trialRecord.trial_pro.pro_title}}</text><text class="tr-product-sub">{{trialRecord.status_text}}</text></view></view></view><button class="ui-secondary tr-native-address" bindtap="yx35PickAddress" disabled="{{busy||submissionUnknown}}"><yx-icon name="location" tone="brand" size="36"/> 从微信选择收货地址</button><text class="tr-manual-note">也可以在下方手动填写或修改</text><form bindsubmit="save"><view class="ui-card tr-address-form"><view><text>收件人</text><input name="username" value="{{yx35Name}}" maxlength="45" placeholder="请填写收件人姓名" disabled="{{busy||submissionUnknown}}"/></view><view><text>联系电话</text><input name="tel" value="{{yx35Tel}}" maxlength="25" placeholder="请填写有效联系方式" disabled="{{busy||submissionUnknown}}"/></view><view><text>收货地址</text><textarea name="address" value="{{yx35Address}}" maxlength="250" placeholder="省市区、街道及门牌号" disabled="{{busy||submissionUnknown}}"/></view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="ui-error">{{error}}</view><button wx:if="{{submissionUnknown}}" class="ui-secondary" bindtap="goHistory">核对试用申请记录</button><view class="tr-fixed-footer"><button form-type="submit" class="ui-primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy||submissionUnknown||!id}}">{{submissionUnknown?'请先核对提交结果':busy?'正在提交':'保存并提交'}}</button></view></form><view class="tr-privacy"><yx-icon name="shield" tone="muted" size="30"/><text>仅收集中选后必要的收货信息</text></view></view></view>
